<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan forex market closed for New Year holidays.</title>
<headline>Taiwan forex market closed for New Year holidays.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's foreign exchange market is closed on Wednesday due to New Year holidays. It will reopen on Saturday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, the Taiwan dollar ended at T$27.491 to the U.S. dollar against Monday's T$27.497 close. Turnover through dealers was US$301.5 million.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
